      "message": "refactor: move getblocktemplate cache into BlockTemplateManager\n\nMove CachedBlockTemplate, GBT_TEMPLATE_REBUILD_INTERVAL and\nGetNewOrCachedBlockTemplate() from rpc/mining.cpp into\nBlockTemplateManager. The file-scope cache becomes a member that is\nstill guarded by cs_main, and the interval becomes a public static\nmember. The longpolling code reads the cached mempool counter through\nthe new GetCachedTransactionsUpdated().\n\nThe cache now lives as long as the node context instead of the process.\n\nApart from the member accesses and declarations, this is a move. It\ncan be reviewed with:\n\ngit show --color-moved=dimmed-zebra --color-moved-ws=allow-indentation-change",
      "committer": {
