      "message": "test: cover the BlockTemplateManager getblocktemplate cache\n\nCheck that GetNewOrCachedBlockTemplate() reuses the cached template\nuntil the tip changes, or until the mempool changes and the template is\nmore than 5 seconds old, and that GetCachedTransactionsUpdated() reports\nthe mempool counter sampled for the last build. Also check that a failed\nrebuild leaves the cache without a template, so that the next call\nretries without waiting for the 5 seconds to pass.\n\nCheck that a replacement manager starts with an empty cache and builds\nits own template on the same tip with the same mempool.\n\nCo-authored-by: Enoch Azariah <66912335+enochaz@users.noreply.github.com>",
