      "message": "test: check the rebuilt getblocktemplate transactions after prioritisetransaction\n\nThe check that prioritisetransaction makes getblocktemplate return a new\nblock compared the whole template. curtime follows the mock clock, so the\ncomparison passed even when the cached template was reused. Check that the\ndeprioritised transaction leaves the template instead.\n\nCo-authored-by: Enoch Azariah <66912335+enochaz@users.noreply.github.com>",
